===Etymology 1===
{{inh+|ru|orv|право}}, from {{der|ru|sla-pro|*pravo}}. Calque of {{cal|ru|de|Recht|notext=1}} and {{cal|ru|fr|droit|notext=1}}, based on {{m|ru|пра́вый||[[right]], [[correct]]; [[straight]]}}. Cognate with {{cog|uk|пра́во}}, {{cog|be|пра́ва}},  {{cog|cu|право}}, {{cog|bg|пра́во}}, {{cog|sh|пра̏во}}, {{cog/sl-tonal|prȃvo}}, {{cog|cs|právo}}, {{cog|sk|právo}}, {{cog|pl|prawo}}.

====Noun====
{{ru-noun+|c|пра́во|adj=правово́й}}

# [[right]]; [[claim]]
#: {{coi|ru|'''права́''' [[человек|челове́ка]]|[[human rights|human '''rights''']]}}
# {{lb|ru|law}} [[law]], [[right]]
#: {{coi|ru|[[гражда́нское '''пра́во''']]|[[civil law|civil '''law''']]}}
#: {{coi|ru|[[ри́мское '''пра́во''']]|[[Roman law|Roman '''law''']]}}
# [[justice]]
# {{lb|ru|in the plural}} [[driving licence]]

